{"schema":"mcpgit.table-batch-transaction.v1","transaction_id":"98d2e610-b904-5f9e-ac56-372d649407c0","idempotency_key":"98d2e610-b904-5f9e-ac56-372d649407c0","actor":{"host":"huawei-ThinkCentre-M920t","kind":"hwlinux-local","repository":"yxsicd/agentlabrelease","runId":"hwlinux-20260929-code-workshop-converge-04"},"recorded_at_unix_ms":1790647952150,"tables":[{"path":"program_facts","operations":[{"op":"insert","operation_id":"2066b520-91ef-521b-afdb-0275ce9e5c0f","key":"agent-analysis-hmosword-build-sample-onboarding","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-hmosword-build-sample-onboarding","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"f3813e6912fd30335b49062e7be6f9d29e8275dcf7e29f1fa061e0be24581f5f"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"4a8faa1fd1ddaa4108ba44d2573e4942b01b56d2","path":"hmosword-build/index.js"},{"gitBlobOid":"aeca4cbf0c1dc2edabedeeac9ccc44bd61dbc1f0","path":"hmosword-build/config/mock.json"},{"gitBlobOid":"26ae0570039c2a38709b0bd670ca551d456a1e7d","path":"hmosword-build/package.json"},{"gitBlobOid":"03ada1b33bb56a68ee5243c459638fe3154523c5","path":"build-profile.json5"}],"id":"agent-analysis-hmosword-build-sample-onboarding","interpretation":"Responsibility: hmosword-build is a Node.js bootstrap helper that clones external HarmonyOS_Samples repos per config/mock.json into ../submodules/ and rewrites each so it registers as a feature module in build-profile.json5. Scope: hmosword-build/{index.js, package.json, config/mock.json} + image/* + screenshots/* PNG (json5 ^2.2.3 is package.json's only dep); writes touch parent build-profile.json5, ../submodules/<sampleName>/, each clone's module.json5/oh-package.json5/build-profile.json5. Behavior: index.js needs fs/path/child_process + json5; readMock iterates mock.json.data; per item derives sampleName + samplePath, skips clone if non-empty, else async `git clone -b <branch> <originalUrl> <samplePath>`; processSample/processSampleWithoutConfig then rewrite the clone (entry->moduleName rename, oh-package.json5.name rewrite, src/main/module.json5 -> type='feature'/deliveryWithInstall=false/abilities[0].name=abilityName/exported=false); configured samples map clone build-profile.json5 modules entry->feature/others leaf; writeBuildProfile appends new modules to parent build-profile.json5.modules; only entry-derived entries carry default-product targets.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["Whether `git clone -b <branch>` succeeds for every originalUrl/branch pair in config/mock.json is unverified: network reachability, SSH/auth availability, and rename drift in the upstream HarmonyOS_Samples repos are not provable from this checkout.","Whether the rewritten modules actually compile under hvigor is unverified; processSampleWithoutConfig only mutates modules whose existing type is 'entry', and silently skips samples whose ohosTest-only module.json5 tree yields an empty cloneSamples list.","The substringFromStartToEnd(moduleName, 6) naming convention assumes every configured moduleName is exactly 6 characters longer than the desired directory name; off-by-one or character-set edge cases are not exercised here.","deleteExtraDir is invoked with (samplePath, needModules) but its declared third parameter moduleName is never used; the cleanup semantics for samples whose build-profile.json5 is missing or whose needModules list is empty are not validated by the source alone."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-hmosword-build"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"e16e193d411a06fb9704bb4bc2f35a285aed6f68601532f20a5ec241a99a93c5","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}},{"op":"insert","operation_id":"0e6394e1-8df7-597b-8804-99b2a47de940","key":"agent-analysis-tv-harmony-entry-module","row":{"id":"agent