profile.json5 (stageMode, runtimeOnly=['@ohos/common']) defines 8 flavors swapping resource dirs; hvigorfile.ts wires hapTasks; module.json5 names EntryAbility and references main_pages.json (SplashPage, MainPage) plus router_map.json (MainPage, TvSettingsView, TvAboutView). Relations: depends on @ohos/common, @ohos/devpractices, @ohos/commonbusiness, @ohos/mine via file: paths into ../common and ../features; imports UI/Ability/BasicServices/Input kits and @hms.hds.hdsBaseComponent. Behavior: EntryAbility.onWindowStageCreate loads SplashPage and initializes WindowUtil, TrackManager, PageContext, BundleManagerUtil, AccountService.serviceInit; SplashViewModel routes to MainPage via PreferenceManager; MainViewModel loads VisionSampleModel banners and triggers abilities via ProcessUtil; MineViewModel handles login/logout via MinePageEvent; HomeContent renders a Swiper of SingleSampleData with experience and source buttons toggling QRCodeSheet.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["Did not verify that the file:../features/mine and file:../features/commonbusiness targets referenced in oh-package.json5 exist as on-disk modules or that their declared exports match the imports used in the TV viewmodels and pages.","Did not exercise runtime behavior on a TV device or in a DevEco Studio preview; only static ETS and JSON source inspection was performed, so transitions such as SplashViewModel.replacePage to PageEnum.MAIN_PAGE and AccountService.login promise flow are not validated at runtime.","Build flavors default and ohosTest lack explicit resource directories in build-profile.json5, so the effective resource precedence for those targets is unconfirmed from source alone.","Per-flavor env.json files (resources_dev, resources_beta, resources_prod, resources, resources/rawfile) declare tvSourceCodeUrl independently; the actual override resolution order at runtime was not exercised."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-products-tv"],"sourceRev